  "body": "The 15LX Slant-PRO lathe, newer than the 15L (#611). The contributor already supplied manual UM10860.\n\nHub (PathPilot v2.14.4, 2026-11-09) lists this model under Current Machine Models. CamCraft does not ship it yet. Requested by the contributor so every Hub machine can be selected and Hub-tested.\n\n**Done means:** it ships as a Tormach lathe (kind lathe) with UM10860's figures, and posts with the PathPilot lathe post (#612).\n\nSpecs come from Tormach's operator manual for the model, its specifications table (contributor-supplied; cite the manual number and section in the decision file), clean-room. Same conventions as the shipped Tormach machines: inch, full-stroke-either-way travel, and a `tormach_machines`-style spec test.\n",
